    "updated_at": "2024-10-19T04:50:38Z",
    "body": "This seems related to my objections in #10673. Ideally you would not be using the module map infrastructure at all, and instead using pure URLs. Then `#fragment` URLs could reference inline style sheets identified by `id=\"\"`.",
